  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can take the form of a large spider.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Cha 13, Spider Shape, base attack bonus +3, werespider-kin.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use Spider Shape to become a spider, you can choose to become a spider or giant black widow spiderB2.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> If you also have the Mystic Spinnerets feat, you gain its benefits while under the effects of this feat. You are always treated as having a free hand for the purposes of using Lashing Spinnerets while in this form.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/skinwalker-heritages#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
